---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | SM Global Accounting Services"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the SM Global Accounting Services website. Please read them before sending us an enquiry."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>

      <p class="placeholder-note" style="margin: var(--space-3) 0; max-width: none;">
        <strong>Draft for review.</strong> These terms cover use of this website only. They are not a
        client engagement contract, and they have not yet been reviewed by a solicitor. Items in
        [square brackets] must be completed before the site goes live.
      </p>

      <div class="grid" style="max-width: 760px; margin-top: var(--space-3); margin-inline: auto;">
        <div>
          <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            This website is operated by {SITE.name}, a business registered in India: [legal entity
            name and registration type and number], [registered address]. Email:
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. By using this site you agree to these
            terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>2. This site is informational</h2>
          <p>
            Content on this site describes our services in general terms. It is not accounting, tax or
            legal advice, and nothing on it forms a contract between us and you. A service engagement
            only begins once we have agreed scope, pricing and terms directly with your practice in a
            separate engagement letter. Actual client work is governed by that letter, not by this page.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>3. Accuracy</h2>
          <p>
            We try to keep this site accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee that every detail
            is current or error-free, and we may change the content at any time without notice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>4. Intellectual property and trademarks</h2>
          <p>
            The content, design and branding on this site belong to {SITE.name} unless otherwise
            stated. You may view and print pages for your own reference, but you may not copy,
            republish or reuse content from this site commercially without our written permission.
          </p>
          <p>
            Product and company names mentioned on this site (for example Xero, QuickBooks, IRIS, CCH
            and TaxCalc) are trademarks of their owners. We use them only to describe the software we
            work in. No partnership with, or endorsement by, those companies is implied.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
          <p>
            This site may link to third-party websites. We do not control those sites and are not
            responsible for their content or their privacy practices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>6. Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of
            this website. This does not limit any liability that cannot legally be excluded or limited.
            [Confirm the final wording with a solicitor.]
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>7. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            [To be confirmed with your solicitor. As an India-registered business you will most likely
            state that these terms are governed by the laws of India and that the courts of Mumbai have
            jurisdiction, while keeping any mandatory rights visitors have under their own local law.]
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>8. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the top shows the current version.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>9. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
            See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
